&lt;li&gt;Deep domain expertise in the Pharmaceutical and Life Sciences manufacturing industry, with a strong understanding of pharma-specific processes and regulations, including batch manufacturing (e.g., ISA-88), GxP compliance (GMP, GLP, etc.), Computer System Validation (CSV) / Computer Software Assurance (CSA), and CFR 21 Part 11.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on in Python, as well as good hands-on expertise with software development best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client-facing skills, with experience building trusted relationships with technology partners, enterprise clients, and internal stakeholders to co-create solutions and drive joint opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in industrial data, OT/IT convergence, and data integration patterns specific to life sciences (e.g., connecting MES, LIMS, Historians, DCS, or SCADA to enterprise systems), with the ability to design scalable architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
