&lt;p&gt;The Principal Field Engineer leads the technical relationship as a customer land from initial validation and into broader expansion adoption. This role serves as a technical leader who acts as a crucial bridge between customers, sales teams, and the product organization to drive mutual business value and ensure solution integrity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Client Engagement and Solution Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical liaison to key clients, establishing trusted relationships and ensuring alignment on solutions, integration architectures, and technical roadmaps. You will move clients from high-level strategy to live, functioning versions of Cognite’s solutions through &lt;strong&gt;Fast AI Prototyping&lt;/strong&gt; via &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Atlas AI™&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Data Fusion®&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
