&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Moving Strategy to Reality:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Account Executives to prioritize strategic opportunities and act as the technical lead for complex engagements. You will move clients from high-level strategy to live, functioning versions of Cognite’s solutions through &lt;strong&gt;Fast AI Prototyping&lt;/strong&gt; via &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Atlas AI™&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Data Fusion®&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
