&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How you’ll demonstrate Ownership&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a visionary Principal Product Manager eager to define the vision, build, and lead the development of intuitive user experiences and robust backend systems that transform industrial operations? At Cognite, we&#39;re not just building software; we&#39;re pioneering the future of industrial data with our award-winning Cognite Data Fusion® platform, recognized as the 2022 Technology Innovation Leader for Global Digital Industrial Platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Product team is at the core of developing Cognite Data Fusion® into a robust and scalable platform for solving critical industrial data problems. This work is central to transforming asset-intensive industries – making them safer, more sustainable, and more profitable. Cognite Data Fusion® makes operational data available at scale, adding immense value through advanced data processing. This empowers industries to make truly data-driven decisions. Our platform leverages many different technologies, each chosen for its ability to solve specific challenges effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To build the best possible product, we believe in autonomous teams where product managers, developers, and designers work closely together. Our teams are focused on building the next-generation industrial data platform and applications across diverse industries like Oil &amp;amp; Gas, Manufacturing, and Power &amp;amp; Utility. This includes enabling all types of workflows, from advanced analytics to assisting in critical decision-making. We&#39;re a strong mix of product managers, engineers, and designers, united by a deep commitment to user experience and creating products users genuinely want to use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work environment is exciting, dynamic, and intense. You&#39;ll collaborate with top-tier domain and industry experts and business leaders. We support one another, ask incisive questions, and give constructive feedback. Our goal is to leverage our diverse strengths and backgrounds to build innovative products, think outside the ordinary, and nurture a truly great culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Impact you bring to Cognite&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Product Manager, you&#39;ll be a key player in setting product direction, building the product, and owning its success across Cognite’s industrial customers. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love making users happy and are committed to creating products they truly want to use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a user-centric mindset: A genuine passion for understanding user needs and designing intuitive, easy-to-use solutions for complex technical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing feature delivery and tradeoffs for a complex product area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at communicating with different types of stakeholders, ranging from customer senior executives to technical engineers and data scientists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You articulate clear and well-structured product requirement documentation that sets the direction for engineering and design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of successful product launches involving AI technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable learning about new developments within the AI space, and use these tools actively yourself for working efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re accustomed to working in an English-speaking environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience mentoring junior colleagues and leading complex product development projects across global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have leadership potential: While initially an individual contributor, you should have the ambition and capability to grow into a leadership role, potentially building and leading a team of product managers in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 10+ years of experience in SaaS product management roles, ideally within the industrial OT and IT space, with a strong understanding of how industrial data is collected, stored, and utilised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
