&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2&quot;&gt;Ready to translate your consulting or delivery expertise into lasting product impact? As a Co-Innovation Program Manager at Cognite, you’ll work right at the seam between emerging AI product development and real-world customer operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3&quot;&gt;Instead of just managing timelines, you will lead customer-partnered programs that put our latest capabilities into production. You’ll listen to how systems perform in the field, synthesize user insights, and partner directly with engineering and product leads to refine our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
