&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with LMS and digital authoring tools; Skilljar, Articulate Rise/Storyline, Synthesia, or similar tools is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior-Level Leadership &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to lead as a senior individual contributor through influence, not formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong stakeholder management across Product, Engineering, Professional Services, Solutions Architecture, Customer Success, and Academy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to independently identify problems, define solutions, and drive initiatives end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-changing environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience mentoring colleagues or raising technical quality is highly desirable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Personal Attributes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technically curious:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoys going deep and continuously learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learner-first:&lt;/strong&gt; Focuses on practical application, not course completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identifies and solves gaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Can engage deeply with engineers and simplify concepts for learners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical problem solver:&lt;/strong&gt; Turns real implementation challenges into learning experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influential collaborator:&lt;/strong&gt; Aligns SMEs and stakeholders without formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative and AI-minded:&lt;/strong&gt; Uses AI and new technologies to improve technical education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; Focuses on enabling successful implementation, adoption, and faster time-to-value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like — First 12–18 Months&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Become a recognized technical authority within Academy for one or more Cognite technology domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and improve key areas of the technical curriculum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Launch high-quality courses, labs, bootcamps, or learning paths addressing customer and partner capability gaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Increase the technical depth and practical value of existing programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver consistently strong training to customers, partners, and internal teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build trusted relationships with Product, Engineering, Professional Services, and Solutions Architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Convert critical SME knowledge into scalable learning assets and reduce dependency on individual SMEs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentor Academy colleagues and raise the team’s technical quality bar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use AI and modern learning technologies to improve content development speed and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate measurable impact on customer adoption, partner capability, implementation readiness, and time-to-value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Cognite Academy?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;industrial AI, data technology, customer success, and technical education&lt;/strong&gt;. You will shape how customers and partners worldwide learn to build with Cognite and directly influence their ability to implement technology successfully and realize value faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for a senior technical professional who enjoys &lt;strong&gt;technology, problem-solving, building, and teaching&lt;/strong&gt;, and wants significant impact as a senior individual contribut&lt;/p&gt;
