&lt;li&gt;Join a team of 70 different nationalities 🌐 with Diversity, Equality and Inclusion (DEI) in focus 🤝.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly modern and fun working environment with sublime culture across the organization, follow us on Instagram @&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/cognitedata/&quot;&gt;cognitedata&lt;/a&gt; 📷 to know more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flat structure with direct access to decision-makers, with minimal amount of bureaucracy&lt;/li&gt;
