&lt;li&gt;Join our &lt;a href=&quot;https://hub.cognite.com/&quot;&gt;HUB&lt;/a&gt; 🗣️ to be part of the conversation directly with Cogniters and our partners.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
