&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;How you’ll demonstrate&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
We&#39;re looking for a Senior AI native designer for our Cognite Oslo team to invent, prototype, and scale next-generation product experiences on top of Cognite Data Fusion (CDF).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll use advanced AI tools and methods to move from insight → concept → working experience with high speed and clarity. You’ll partner closely with product, engineering, strategy, and customers to uncover unmet needs, validate hypotheses, and turn ambiguous problems into elegant, testable, data-aware solutions. You’re hands-on, experimental, and fluent in AI— converting user research to compelling prototypes, and shaping trustworthy, human-in-the-loop experiences that deliver business impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/span&gt; you bring to Cognite&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Design Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype with real data and real models&lt;/strong&gt;: connect to mock data or internal APIs; validate flows under realistic latency, streaming, and cost constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for probabilistic systems&lt;/strong&gt;: author patterns for imperfect answers, disagreement handling, correction, and escalation to humans-in-the-loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Express ideas at multiple fidelities&lt;/strong&gt;: from prompt-generated concept boards to interactive agents, micro-workflows, and production-ready UI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with business designers and product strategists&lt;/strong&gt; to evaluate desirability, feasibility, and viability; shape experience KPIs and success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tell the story&lt;/strong&gt; through compelling narratives, visuals, and prototypes that make the future feel obvious—and shippable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead design sessions&lt;/strong&gt; and facilitate cross-functional workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Execution &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own outcomes end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt; from discovery to shipped experience: research plans, flows, systems, content, and component-level detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operationalize AI in the UX&lt;/strong&gt;: define tool/agent contracts, error states, monitoring hooks, and feedback loops to continuously improve quality and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate tightly with engineering&lt;/strong&gt; to scope increments, derisk hard problems early, and land details with high craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuously validate&lt;/strong&gt; via user research, experiment design, and rapid iteration; make evidence-based tradeoffs across user value, reliability, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of product design experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency with AI-native workflows&lt;/strong&gt;: prompt design, evaluation, and chaining; agents/tools; RAG; model/runtime constraints (latency, token/cost budgets).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on prototyping with real data&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., connecting prototypes to APIs/SDKs, lightweight code, or no/low-code tools) to validate feasibility and UX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong user research skills&lt;/strong&gt;: plan and run studies, synthesize qualitative &amp;amp; quantitative signals into clear insights and direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio&lt;/strong&gt; demonstrating end-to-end ownership of complex, data-heavy or AI-powered experiences, including trust/safety and human-in-the-loop patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent collaboration &amp;amp; communication&lt;/strong&gt;: proactive stakeholder management, clear storytelling, and comfort presenting to executives and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
