&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Moving Strategy to Reality:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Account Executives to prioritize strategic opportunities and act as the technical lead for complex engagements. You will move clients from high-level strategy to live, functioning versions of Cognite’s solutions through &lt;strong&gt;Fast AI Prototyping&lt;/strong&gt; via &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Atlas AI™&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Data Fusion®&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Solution Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design and implementation of first-of-their-kind industrial agents. You will leverage the &lt;strong&gt;Atlas AI&lt;/strong&gt; workbench to automate complex industrial workflows, ensuring solutions are technically feasible, scalable, and grounded in the contextualized data foundation of our &lt;strong&gt;Industrial Knowledge Graph&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Representation &amp;amp; Use Case Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead use case workshops and briefings, translating functional and non-functional requirements into deliverable high-level use cases. You will build executive confidence by delivering client-focused demos and reference architectures that prove the ROI of Industrial AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Innovation &amp;amp; Field Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the critical bridge between the field and Cognite’s Product organization. Translate &quot;field friction&quot; and deployment learnings into actionable product requirements and scalable best practices that strengthen Cognite’s position as the leader in &lt;strong&gt;Industrial DataOps&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/span&gt; you bring to Cognite&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industrial Architecture Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to design scalable architectures that unify siloed IT/OT/ET data into a single source of truth using &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Data Fusion®&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience building with LLMs (Gemini, Claude, GPT-4) and a deep understanding of the Agentic AI landscape to create trusted, mission-critical industrial agents via &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Atlas AI™&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Solution Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to orchestrate and build end-to-end prototypes—integrating GenAI components, CDF data models, and legacy customer systems—using scalable software practices and open-source AI frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Evangelism &amp;amp; Strategic Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to distill complex technical AI solutions into compelling, value-driven narratives. You can pivot seamlessly between deep architectural sessions with engineers and strategy briefings with C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in forward deployed engineering/pre-sales engineering roles ideally in enterprise SaaS, cloud platforms, or industrial software companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering background. Preferred fields include but are not limited to Computer Science, Mathematics, Software Engineering, Physics, and Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong foundation in Python and a deep understanding of the GenAI landscape (embeddings, RAG, and prompt chaining).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, analytical, and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and interest to travel up to 50% as needed to be &quot;on the ground&quot; where the impact happens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education or experience in the industrial space (e.g., Petroleum, Chemical, Mechanical, or Control System Engineering).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous customer facing or sales experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked with &quot;messy&quot; real-world variables from the Industries we work in (Energy, Oil and Gas, Chemicals, Life Sciences, Discrete) and understand, for example, why data quality in a refinery is harder than data quality in a web app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited to bridge the gap between traditional heavy industry and the future of Autonomous Operations via &lt;strong&gt;Cognite Data Fusion®&lt;/strong&gt; and Agentic AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
