&lt;h1&gt;How you’ll demonstrate&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Cognite, we&#39;re transforming the world&#39;s most asset-intensive industries through Industrial AI. Our customers rely on us to turn complex industrial data into meaningful business outcomes—and this is where you come in.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Project Manager who enjoys solving complex challenges, takes ownership of outcomes, and is motivated by delivering measurable value. This role goes beyond managing timelines; you&#39;ll lead transformational AI implementation projects that help some of the world&#39;s largest industrial organisations modernise the way they operate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;From contract signing through deployment and value realisation, you&#39;ll partner with customers and cross-functional teams to deliver successful projects that create lasting business impact.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/span&gt; you bring to Cognite&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As the Project Manager, you&#39;ll be accountable for the successful delivery of complex Industrial AI implementation projects by:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading end-to-end project delivery from kickoff through deployment, adoption, and value realisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning project scope, schedule, budget, quality, customer outcomes, and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with Solution Architects, Software Engineers, Data Scientists, Product teams, and Customer Success to deliver high-quality solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating customer objectives into measurable success metrics and facilitating Value Realisation Workshops to demonstrate business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing project financials, including forecasting, revenue recognition, profitability, cost management, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building trusted relationships with customer stakeholders, leading steering committees, and providing clear communication throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and managing risks, dependencies, and scope changes while ensuring appropriate governance and transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting customer adoption through change management, enablement, and training while recognising opportunities to expand customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the continuous improvement of delivery practices by applying Cognite&#39;s PMO methodologies, playbooks, and lessons learned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, or a related technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience delivering complex software, SaaS, cloud, or enterprise technology implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing enterprise or industrial digital transformation programmes involving multiple stakeholders and technical workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency with APIs, integrations, cloud platforms, data architecture, and enterprise systems, enabling effective collaboration with technical teams and informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and financial acumen, including forecasting, revenue recognition, margin management, and project profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within Life Sciences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Agile delivery methodologies and project governance frameworks such as Scrum, PMP, or PRINCE2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to engage confidently across technical teams, customers, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using project management tools such as Jira, Confluence, Microsoft Project, or Smartsheet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 25% as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred skills:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re particularly interested if you also bring experience in:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PRINCE2, Agile, or Scrum certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud platforms such as Azure or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industrial IoT, SCADA, MES, or Operational Technology (OT) environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI, Machine Learning, Data Engineering, or Analytics implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Cognite?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cognite, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to work at the forefront of Industrial AI, partnering with some of the world&#39;s leading industrial organisations to solve complex, real-world challenges.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll join a collaborative, inclusive, and fast-moving environment where innovation, curiosity, and continuous learning are encouraged. We value diverse perspectives and believe great ideas come from people with different experiences and backgrounds.&lt;br&gt;If you&#39;re excited by technology, enjoy working with customers to solve meaningful problems, and want to help shape the future of industry, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
