&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;How you’ll demonstrate &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
As a Senior Fullstack Engineer at Cognite, you will be a key driver in building our products end to end, from intuitive user facing applications to the APIs and services that power them. You’ll take ownership of complex features from ideation to deployment, designing solutions that are engaging, secure, and scalable across the entire stack. Working closely with product, design, and fellow engineers, you’ll help shape technical direction, raise the quality bar through code reviews and mentoring, and ensure we’re shipping a seamless, reliable experience for our users.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/span&gt; you bring to Cognite&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A typical day as a Cogniter will contain the following tasks &amp;amp; responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a wide range of systems, processes, and technologies and own and solve problems end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate in a fast-paced environment involving different stakeholders and subject matter experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using your fullstack development skills to build tools that extract key information from documents and connect data, such that users can make the most of their industrial data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement elegant APIs, user experiences, and the underlying infrastructure that leverage smart algorithms and AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be actively involved in setting product and technical direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our skilled users to understand their needs and build products to help them succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6+ years of fullstack software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a&lt;strong&gt; bachelor&#39;s degree or more&lt;/strong&gt; in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or similar, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can learn new coding languages and use the language that best fits the purpose. In particular, you have hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Python and any Python backend framework (FastAPI, Flask, Django)&lt;/strong&gt;. Previous experience writing code in Kotlin is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have front-end experience in frameworks like &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Angular&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Vue&lt;/strong&gt;, or something similar and a solid grasp of &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript &lt;/strong&gt;and enjoy the benefits of &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with some of the following:&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; Platform services, &lt;strong&gt;Azure&lt;/strong&gt;, and/or &lt;strong&gt;AWS.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure, &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt;, and other related technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with distributed open-source software such as &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Elasticsearch&lt;/strong&gt;, and similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about unit testing, integration testing, and E2E testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write well-structured, efficient, and maintainable code and actively keep the quality of the codebase in check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for emerging web technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with prompt engineering and integrating with large language models through e.g. &lt;strong&gt;langchain, fabric&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
