&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll demonstrate Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Account Manager, you will be the primary architect of Cognite’s relationship with our most high-value global Life Sciences and Pharmaceutical accounts. You won’t just manage a portfolio; you will act as a “CEO of the account,” fostering deep strategic partnerships and driving aggressive growth through a value-first mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute comprehensive account strategies to drive value realization, double-digit ARR growth, and new opportunity capture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate multi-level relationships across the client organization, including manufacturing, quality, IT, and digital leadership, acting as the primary point of contact and lead advocate for their success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead a cross-functional “extended territory team” (including Tech Sales, Value Delivery, Product, Marketing, Partners) to ensure seamless execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Rigorously apply value-selling methodologies, specifically Command of the Message and MEDDPICC, to maintain high-quality sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Master Cognite’s solution suite to articulate how our technology uniquely solves complex manufacturing and operational challenges in regulated environments and drives ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex negotiations for large enterprise contracts, focusing on favorable business terms and value-based pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain precise forecasts, pipeline data, and detailed account/close plans to provide actionable insights to corporate leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Engage directly with clients on-site (approx. 50% travel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact you bring to Cognite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of direct enterprise software/SaaS sales experience, consistently exceeding quotas in high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Life Sciences, Pharmaceutical, or Biotech manufacturing industries, including the regulatory and quality context (e.g., GxP, validation requirements) that shapes how these customers buy and adopt technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; High fluency in SaaS, Cloud, Big Data, and Generative AI; you should be comfortable discussing ARR, NRR, and TCV, and manage subscription pricing models and large service programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Political Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong relationship-building skills, focused on a high level of customer service; you can read and navigate organizational politics, including the interplay between Operations, Quality, and IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A blend of high-energy ambition and “coachability.” You thrive in ambiguity and are proactive in resolving issues with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in building business cases and navigating complex Excel/PowerPoint deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree (Master’s preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of selling to C-Level stakeholders across both Business and IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including good presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous training in Command of the Message or MEDDPICC is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Salesforce and modern sales engagement stacks.&lt;/li&gt;
